    "detailed_description": "Roll the dice in your mind and try to figure out which number will end up on top when it stops. Remember, this isn't about luck even though I'm asking you to 'predict.' Every time you guess wrong, the game changes, making it a bit trickier. A crucial detail: the opposite sides of a die always add up to seven. Your goal? To become the ultimate 'dicempion' by carefully thinking through each move. Or just complete the game.<br><br>\u25cf 444 levels<br>\u25cf Minimalistic design<br>\u25cf Trains your brain? Quite possibly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747540/extras/fa02278680c81cf9a8deb254d946b1bb.poster.avif?t=1747770511\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747540/extras/fa02278680c81cf9a8deb254d946b1bb.webm?t=1747770511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747540/extras/fa02278680c81cf9a8deb254d946b1bb.mp4?t=1747770511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Oh, and if you find any tricks that make solving the puzzles easier, don't spread the word. Keep those secrets to yourself.",
